{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間周三（18日），<strong>穆迪評級將英偉達公司的信用評級展望從「正面」下調至「穩定」，</strong>理由是長期擔任行政總裁的黃仁勳辭職以及該公司「缺乏正式的繼任計劃」。穆迪指出，儘管該機構認為英偉達的市場領導地位和財務狀況依然非常強勁，但<strong>在未來12至18個月內，英偉達的信用評級幾乎不存在上調空間。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587050.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.861675+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:15:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_hash":"ad559cff6a0ef81b45d1a5f5b77e4f3eee23b7b3558803e2b4e6025a84e01b2f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}